{"id":"n24907-1-7","stage":5,"title":"잦다 · 频繁","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24907-1-7-1","ko":"몸에 나타나는 특별한 변화는 없었나요?","zh":"身体有没有出现什么异常变化呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"몸에","meaning":"身体，身子","explanation":"몸：身体，身子；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"몸","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74138","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나타나는","meaning":"出现","explanation":"나타나다：出现；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"나타나다","audio":"/audio/d6fb8e71960ac8027a14.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62286","senseId":"5","lemma":"나타나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"특별한","meaning":"特别，特殊","explanation":"특별하다：特别，特殊；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"특별하다","audio":"/audio/b187aff392c86f2bfccd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71297","senseId":"1","lemma":"특별하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"변화는","meaning":"变化","explanation":"변화：变化；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"변화","audio":"/audio/d06231d77cebc3d059aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83169","senseId":"1","lemma":"변화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없었나요?","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"3","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"955149b012635be1","term":"몸","zh":"身体，身子","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3","entryId":"74138","definition":"指从头到脚组成人或动物形象的整体；或指其状态。","pronunciation":["몸"]},{"id":"d6fb8e71960ac802","term":"나타나다","zh":"出现","audio":"/audio/d6fb8e71960ac8027a14.mp3","entryId":"62286","definition":"新的现象或事物呈现或产生。","pronunciation":["나타나다"]},{"id":"b187aff392c86f2b","term":"특별하다","zh":"特别，特殊","audio":"/audio/b187aff392c86f2bfccd.mp3","entryId":"71297","definition":"与普通事物非常不同。","pronunciation":["특뼐하다"]},{"id":"d06231d77cebc3d0","term":"변화","zh":"变化","audio":"/audio/d06231d77cebc3d059aa.mp3","entryId":"83169","definition":"某物的样子、状态或性质等变得不同。","pronunciation":["변ː화"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不发生某个事情或症状。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/fec108efaf7920475c57.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24907-1-7-2","ko":"요즘 들어 소변이 잦아서 자꾸 화장실에 가게 돼요.","zh":"最近尿频，总是要频繁去厕所。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들어","meaning":"进入，陷入","explanation":"들다：进入，陷入；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"10","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소변이","meaning":"小便","explanation":"소변：小便；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"소변","audio":"/audio/dba740fe77b6bf4db954.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63769","senseId":"1","lemma":"소변","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잦아서","meaning":"频繁","explanation":"잦다：频繁；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"잦다","audio":"/audio/81b04c89c652c81f8820.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24907","senseId":"1","lemma":"잦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"화장실에","meaning":"洗手间，卫生间","explanation":"화장실：洗手间，卫生间；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"화장실","audio":"/audio/477b8e1cccfde276bae7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30211","senseId":"1","lemma":"화장실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가게","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돼요.","meaning":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","explanation":"되다：变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"进入，陷入","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"71686","definition":"处于某种处境或变成某种状态。","pronunciation":["들다"]},{"id":"dba740fe77b6bf4d","term":"소변","zh":"小便","audio":"/audio/dba740fe77b6bf4db954.mp3","entryId":"63769","definition":"(文雅)人的尿。","pronunciation":["소ː변"]},{"id":"81b04c89c652c81f","term":"잦다","zh":"频繁","audio":"/audio/81b04c89c652c81f8820.mp3","entryId":"24907","definition":"数次反复的间隔非常短。","pronunciation":["잗따"]},{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"자꾸","zh":"一直，总是","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3","entryId":"70796","definition":"多次连续地。","pronunciation":["자꾸"]},{"id":"477b8e1cccfde276","term":"화장실","zh":"洗手间，卫生间","audio":"/audio/477b8e1cccfde276bae7.mp3","entryId":"30211","definition":"设有供大便和小便排出体外的设施的地方。","pronunciation":["화장실"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b4b5e5b95f6fde5d597d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.489,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24907"